    "longDescription": "▣ How to easily transmit content from iPhone to Galaxy.\nSmart Switch can move contacts, calendar events, reminders, photos, and videos to Galaxy devices.\n* Note: After the data transfer is completed, the data of the sender device is maintained. (Not deleted).\n\n▣ How can I send it?\n- Search and run Smart Switch in the settings of Galaxy device.\n- Search and download “Samsung Smart Switch” from App Store and connect and send it according to the guide.\n\n▣ What can I send?\n- Contacts, calendar events, reminders, photos, videos\n* You can use the USB connector to send more items when connecting.",
